        <h2>A dive at the Palomino Islands</h2>
        <p class="justify">On the shared service there is a single dive at the Palomino Islands: divers travel with the other guests and, on arrival, while everyone else watches or swims with the sea lions, the divers complete their dive with their instructor (around 40 minutes on average) and then return to the yacht to head back with the group.</p>
        <p><strong>Requirement:</strong> a valid original Scuba diving card from any certified international body (PADI, CMAS, etc.).</p>
